{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Update the existing **RootSyntax Contact Us section** with a premium dark, modern UI. Keep the existing content and functionality, but make the following updates:
    
    ### Design
    
    * Background: `#050505`
    * Two-column desktop layout: 65% form / 35% contact information
    * Max-width: 1400px
    * Card background: `#0F0F12`
    * Border: `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`
    * Border radius: 20–24px
    * Accent colors: Orange `#FF7A00` and Purple `#6C4CFF`
    * White headings and light-gray body text
    * Fully responsive on mobile
    
    ### Contact Form
    
    * Heading: **GET IN TOUCH**
    * Keep Name, Email, Phone Number and Message fields.
    * **Make all placeholder text inside the input fields clearly visible.** Do not use extremely dark placeholder text.
    * Add a Theme Editor setting for **Input Placeholder Color** so I can customize it.
    * Default placeholder color: `#777777` or another clearly readable gray.
    * Input text should be white and clearly visible when the user types.
    * Input labels should remain white/light gray.
    * Keep Project Timeline options: ⚡ ASAP, 📅 1–2 Months, 🚀 3–6 Months.
    * Selected timeline gets an orange border/glow.
    * Keep Book A Time Slot with Date, Time and AM/PM.
    * Full-width **SEND** button with orange-to-purple gradient.
    * Keep existing consent/privacy text.
    
    ### Contact Information
    
    Heading: **WE'D LOVE TO HEAR FROM YOU.**
    
    Create clean informational cards for:
    
    **WORKING HOURS**
    Monday to Friday – 9:30 am to 4 pm EST
    
    **EMAIL US**
    [info@rootsyntax.com](mailto:info@rootsyntax.com)
    
    **CONTACT NUMBER**
    +1 352-218-5661
    
    Use consistent orange/purple gradient circular icons with white icons.
    
    ### Office Locations
    
    Create two stacked informational cards:
    
    **USA, FLORIDA**
    6160 SW Highway 200
    Ste. 110 PMB508
    Ocala, FL 34486
    7901 4TH ST N STE 300,
    Saint Petersburg, FL 33702
    
    **INDIA, BANGALORE**
    91 Springboard Business Hub Private Ltd.,512/10,
    Service Lane,
    Outer Ring Road,
    Mahadevapura,
    Bangalore 560048
    
    For both location cards:
    
    * Location-pin icon on the left.
    * Address content on the right.
    * **Absolutely NO arrow or chevron on the right side.**
    * Do not make these cards clickable.
    * Do not add links, cursor-pointer behavior, directional icons, or navigation behavior.
    * **Remove all hover effects from the location cards.**
    * No hover lift, glow, color change, underline, or animation.
    * They must behave strictly as static informational cards.
    
    ### Trust Card
    
    Add:
    ★★★★★
    **146+ Shopify Projects Delivered**
    98% Client Satisfaction
    
    Include a subtle orange-to-purple gradient progress bar.
    
    ### Theme Editor Customization
    
    Make the following editable through the Shopify Theme Editor:
    
    * Section heading
    * Form labels
    * Placeholder text
    * **Input placeholder color**
    * Input text color
    * Contact information
    * Office addresses
    * Button text
    * Button colors
    * Card background
    * Border color
    * Spacing
    * Card radius
    * Gradient colors
    * Trust card visibility
    
    ### Important
    
    Keep the design minimal, premium, and conversion-focused.
    
    **The input placeholder text must be clearly visible.**
    
    **The USA and India location cards are static informational content only. They must NOT be clickable and must NOT have any hover effect, arrow, chevron, link icon, or directional icon.**
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .rootsyntax-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 65% 35%;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 48px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder {
    color: {{ block.settings.input_placeholder_color }};
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    min-height: 120px;
    resize: vertical;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder {
    color: {{ block.settings.input_placeholder_color }};
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-form-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-timeline-options-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}.selected {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 122, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-timeslot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-timeslot-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.accent_orange }} 0%, {{ block.settings.accent_purple }} 100%);
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(255, 122, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-consent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-consent-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-consent-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-info-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.accent_orange }} 0%, {{ block.settings.accent_purple }} 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-info-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    stroke: #ffffff;
    fill: none;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-info-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-location-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-location-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.accent_orange }} 0%, {{ block.settings.accent_purple }} 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-location-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    stroke: #ffffff;
    fill: none;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-location-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-location-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-location-address-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-trust-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-trust-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-trust-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-trust-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-trust-progress-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 6px;
    background: {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .rootsyntax-contact-trust-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: 100%;
    width: 98%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, {{ block.settings.accent_orange }} 0%, {{ block.settings.accent_purple }} 100%);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .rootsyntax-contact-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .rootsyntax-contact-form-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }

    .rootsyntax-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .rootsyntax-contact-timeline-options-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .rootsyntax-contact-timeslot-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .rootsyntax-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top | divided_by: 2 }}px 16px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom | divided_by: 2 }}px;
    }

    .rootsyntax-contact-form-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .rootsyntax-contact-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<rootsyntax-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="rootsyntax-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="rootsyntax-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="rootsyntax-contact-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="rootsyntax-contact-form-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h2 class="rootsyntax-contact-form-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.form_heading }}</h2>
        
        {%- form 'contact' -%}
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-form-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="rootsyntax-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="rootsyntax-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <label class="rootsyntax-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.name_label }}
                </label>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  id="contact-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  name="contact[name]"
                  class="rootsyntax-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  placeholder="{{ block.settings.name_placeholder }}"
                  required
                >
              </div>
              
              <div class="rootsyntax-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <label class="rootsyntax-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-email-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.email_label }}
                </label>
                <input
                  type="email"
                  id="contact-email-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  name="contact[email]"
                  class="rootsyntax-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  placeholder="{{ block.settings.email_placeholder }}"
                  required
                >
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rootsyntax-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <label class="rootsyntax-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-phone-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.phone_label }}
              </label>
              <input
                type="tel"
                id="contact-phone-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                name="contact[phone]"
                class="rootsyntax-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                placeholder="{{ block.settings.phone_placeholder }}"
              >
            </div>

            <div class="rootsyntax-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <label class="rootsyntax-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.message_label }}
              </label>
              <textarea
                id="contact-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                name="contact[body]"
                class="rootsyntax-contact-form-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                placeholder="{{ block.settings.message_placeholder }}"
                required
              ></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="rootsyntax-contact-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <label class="rootsyntax-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.timeline_label }}
              </label>
              <div class="rootsyntax-contact-timeline-options-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <label class="rootsyntax-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-timeline="asap">
                  <input type="radio" name="contact[timeline]" value="ASAP" class="rootsyntax-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  ⚡ ASAP
                </label>
                <label class="rootsyntax-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-timeline="1-2-months">
                  <input type="radio" name="contact[timeline]" value="1-2 Months" class="rootsyntax-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  📅 1–2 Months
                </label>
                <label class="rootsyntax-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-timeline="3-6-months">
                  <input type="radio" name="contact[timeline]" value="3-6 Months" class="rootsyntax-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  🚀 3–6 Months
                </label>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rootsyntax-contact-timeslot-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <label class="rootsyntax-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.timeslot_label }}
              </label>
              <div class="rootsyntax-contact-timeslot-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <input
                  type="text"
                  name="contact[date]"
                  class="rootsyntax-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  placeholder="{{ block.settings.date_placeholder }}"
                >
                <input
                  type="text"
                  name="contact[time]"
                  class="rootsyntax-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  placeholder="{{ block.settings.time_placeholder }}"
                >
                <select name="contact[period]" class="rootsyntax-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <option value="AM">AM</option>
                  <option value="PM">PM</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="rootsyntax-contact-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.button_text }}
            </button>

            <div class="rootsyntax-contact-consent-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.consent_text }}
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endform -%}
      </div>

      <div class="rootsyntax-contact-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h3 class="rootsyntax-contact-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.info_heading }}</h3>

        <div class="rootsyntax-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-info-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h4 class="rootsyntax-contact-info-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.hours_title }}</h4>
            <p class="rootsyntax-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.hours_text }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rootsyntax-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-info-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h4 class="rootsyntax-contact-info-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.email_title }}</h4>
            <p class="rootsyntax-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <a href="mailto:{{ block.settings.email_address }}">{{ block.settings.email_address }}</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rootsyntax-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-info-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h4 class="rootsyntax-contact-info-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.phone_title }}</h4>
            <p class="rootsyntax-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <a href="tel:{{ block.settings.contact_number }}">{{ block.settings.contact_number }}</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rootsyntax-contact-location-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-location-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-location-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h4 class="rootsyntax-contact-location-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.usa_location_title }}</h4>
            <p class="rootsyntax-contact-location-address-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.usa_location_address }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rootsyntax-contact-location-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-location-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-location-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h4 class="rootsyntax-contact-location-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.india_location_title }}</h4>
            <p class="rootsyntax-contact-location-address-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.india_location_address }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        {% if block.settings.show_trust_card %}
          <div class="rootsyntax-contact-trust-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="rootsyntax-contact-trust-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">★★★★★</div>
            <h4 class="rootsyntax-contact-trust-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.trust_title }}</h4>
            <p class="rootsyntax-contact-trust-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.trust_subtitle }}</p>
            <div class="rootsyntax-contact-trust-progress-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="rootsyntax-contact-trust-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</rootsyntax-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class RootSyntaxContact{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.setupTimelineSelection();
      }

      setupTimelineSelection() {
        const timelineOptions = this.querySelectorAll('.rootsyntax-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        
        timelineOptions.forEach(option => {
          option.addEventListener('click', function() {
            timelineOptions.forEach(opt => opt.classList.remove('selected'));
            this.classList.add('selected');
            this.querySelector('input').checked = true;
          });
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('rootsyntax-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }}', RootSyntaxContact{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

